        "id": 0,
        "original_id": "73e7324f-d925-5568-a7ff-092e5585a7f1",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Tom Wu, Guy Ritchie, Jason Statham, Ray Liotta, Vincent Pastore, André Benjamin, Anubhav Sinha, Shah Rukh Khan, Arjun Rampal, Kareena Kapoor, Armaan Verma, Shahana Goswami, Kanika Dhillon, Karim Morani\n- Films: Revolver, Ra.One, Chennai Express\n- Places: Hong Kong, Chinatown, London\n- Roles: actor, director, writer, producer\n\nFacts:\n- Tom Wu was born in Hong Kong and grew up in Chinatown, London.\n- Revolver is a 2005 British-French crime thriller film co-written and directed by Guy Ritchie and starring Jason Statham, Ray Liotta, Vincent Pastore, and André Benjamin.\n- Ra.One is a 2011 Indian superhero film directed by Anubhav Sinha and starring Shah Rukh Khan, Arjun Rampal, Kareena Kapoor, Armaan Verma, Shahana Goswami, and Tom Wu.\n- The script for Ra.One was written by Anubhav Sinha and Kanika Dhillon.\n- The idea for Ra.One originated when Anubhav Sinha saw a television commercial and then expanded the concept.\n- Karim Morani is an Indian film producer who produced Chennai Express and Ra.One, both starring Shah Rukh Khan.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
      {
